 debug CLI\uff09", "content_html": "dump state utility \u2014 SONiC \u306e\u6a5f\u80fd\u306f\u8907\u6570 DB\uff08CONFIG_DB / APPL_DB / ASIC_DB / STATE_DB / COUNTERS_DB / \u8a2d\u5b9a JSON\uff09\u306b\u72b6\u614b\u304c\u5206\u6563\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30e2\u30b8\u30e5\u30fc\u30eb\u5358\u4f4d\u3067\u95a2\u9023 key \u3092 DB \u6a2a\u65ad\u306b\u96c6\u7d04\u3059\u308b debug CLI\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/dump-utility-for-easy-debugging.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:51:27+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/support-multiple-user-defined-redis-database-instances/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/support-multiple-user-defined-redis-database-instances/", "title": "\u8907\u6570 Redis \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u306e\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u5b9a\u7fa9\uff08database_config.json \u3067 DB \u3092\u5206\u6563\uff09", "content_html": "database_config.json \u3067 Redis \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u6570\u3068 DB \u5272\u5f53\u3092\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u5b9a\u7fa9\u3057\u3001\u30db\u30c3\u30c8\u30b9\u30dd\u30c3\u30c8\u5316\u3057\u305f\u5358\u4e00 Redis \u3092\u8907\u6570\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u306b\u5206\u6563\u3059\u308b SONiC \u306e\u8d77\u52d5\u7d4c\u8def\u3068 JSON \u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u4ed5\u69d8\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/support-multiple-user-defined-redis-database-instances.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T18:22:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/smart-switch-gnmi-feedback-design-omit-in-toc/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/smart-switch-gnmi-feedback-design-omit-in-toc/", "title": "SmartSwitch gNMI \u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\uff08DPU APPL_STATE_DB \u3068 version_id\uff09", "content_html": "SmartSwitch gNMI \u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af HLD \u306e\u89e3\u8aac\u3002NPU \u4e0a\u306e gNMI \u30b5\u30fc\u30d0\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u5404 DPU \u3092\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3057\u305f\u7d50\u679c\u3092 DPU APPL_STATE_DB \u3068 version_id \u3067\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u3078\u8fd4\u3059\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u6a5f\u69cb\u3092\u6271\u3046\u3002\u672c HLD \u306f\u73fe\u884c master \u3068\u4e56\u96e2\u3042\u308a\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/smart-switch-gnmi-feedback-design-omit-in-toc.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T17:35:58+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/sfputil-add-the-ability-to-read-write-any-byte-from-eerpom-both-by-page-and-offset/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/sfputil-add-the-ability-to-read-write-any-byte-from-eerpom-both-by-page-and-offset/", "title": "sfputil read-eeprom / write-eeprom\uff08\u30da\u30fc\u30b8 + \u30aa\u30d5\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u6307\u5b9a\u3067 SFP/QSFP EEPROM \u64cd\u4f5c\uff09", "content_html": "sfputil read-eeprom / write-eeprom\uff08\u30da\u30fc\u30b8 + \u30aa\u30d5\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u6307\u5b9a\u3067 SFP/QSFP EEPROM \u64cd\u4f5c\uff09 \u2014 \u65e2\u5b58 platform API sfp.read_eeprom / sfp.write_eeprom \u306f \u300c\u5168\u4f53 offset\u300d \u3057\u304b\u53d6\u3089\u305a\u3001\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u306f\u898f\u683c\u6bce\u306b page/of\u2026", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/sfputil-add-the-ability-to-read-write-any-byte-from-eerpom-both-by-page-and-offset.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T20:44:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/", "title": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary)", "content_html": "\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6 (Glossary) \u2014 SONiC NOS \u3067\u983b\u51fa\u3059\u308b\u56fa\u6709\u7528\u8a9e\u30fb\u7565\u8a9e\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30dd\u30fc\u30cd\u30f3\u30c8\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30d9\u30fc\u30b9\u540d\u30fb\u30c7\u30fc\u30e2\u30f3\u540d\u3092\u3001\u30a2\u30eb\u30d5\u30a1\u30d9\u30c3\u30c8\u9806\u306b\u6574\u7406\u3057\u305f\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u7528\u8a9e\u96c6\u3067\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30a8\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u306f\u300c\u7528\u8a9e / \u7565\u79f0 / \u65e5\u672c\u8a9e\u8a33 / \u7c21\u6f54\u306a\u8aac\u660e / \u95a2\u9023\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u300d\u306e\u5f62\u5f0f\u3067\u8a18\u8f09\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T18:14:52+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-lldp/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-lldp/", "title": "show lldp \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "show lldp \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 show lldp \u306f LLDP (Link Layer Discovery Protocol) \u96a3\u63a5\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b\u30b0\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3002\u5b9f\u4f53\u306f lldpd \u30d7\u30ed\u30bb\u30b9\u304c\u53ce\u96c6\u3057\u305f\u96a3\u63a5\u60c5\u5831\u3092\u3001SONiC \u540c\u68b1\u306e lldpshow \u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30c8\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30c3\u30c8\u3057\u3066\u51fa\u529b\u3059\u308b\u8584\u3044\u30e9\u30c3\u30d1\u3067\u3042\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-lldp.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T06:01:44+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-uptime/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-uptime/", "title": "show uptime \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9", "content_html": "show uptime \u30b5\u30d6\u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9 \u2014 show uptime \u306f \u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u306e\u7a3c\u50cd\u6642\u9593\u3092 uptime -p \u3067\u300cpretty \u5f62\u5f0f\u300d\u3067\u8868\u793a\u3059\u308b click \u30b3\u30de\u30f3\u30c9\u3002\u51fa\u529b\u4f8b: up 3 weeks, 2 days, 4 hours, 15 minutes\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-uptime.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:13:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/minigraph-reload-stuck/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/minigraph-reload-stuck/", "title": "minigraph \u9069\u7528\u5f8c\u306b reload \u304c\u5b8c\u4e86\u3057\u306a\u3044 / \u8d77\u52d5\u304c\u56fa\u307e\u308b", "content_html": "`config load_minigraph` \u5b9f\u884c\u5f8c\u306b reload \u304c\u7d42\u308f\u3089\u306a\u3044 / swss \u304c activating \u306e\u307e\u307e\u56fa\u307e\u308b\u969b\u306e\u5207\u308a\u5206\u3051 runbook\u3002minigraph.xml \u69cb\u6587\u30fbhwsku \u6574\u5408\u30fbport_config.ini \u305a\u308c\u30fbhostcfgd / syncd \u8d77\u52d5\u9806\u3092\u9806\u306b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/minigraph-reload-stuck.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T08:51:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/bgp-router-id-explicitly-configured/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/bgp-router-id-explicitly-configured/", "title": "BGP router-id \u3092\u660e\u793a\u7684\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3059\u308b\uff08DEVICE_METADATA.bgp_router_id\uff09", "content_html": "BGP router-id \u3092\u660e\u793a\u7684\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3059\u308b\uff08DEVICE_METADATA.bgp_router_id\uff09 \u2014 SONiC \u306e BGP \u306f\u9577\u3089\u304f Loopback \u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30d5\u30a7\u30fc\u30b9\u306e IPv4 \u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u3092\u6697\u9ed9\u7684\u306b router-id \u3068\u3057\u3066\u4f7f\u3046 \u8a2d\u8a08\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305f\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/bgp-router-id-explicitly-configured.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T13:08:34+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/overlay-ecmp-with-bfd-monitoring/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/overlay-ecmp-with-bfd-monitoring/", "title": "Overlay ECMP with BFD monitoring\uff08VxLAN VNet \u30eb\u30fc\u30c8\u3068 BFD \u9023\u52d5\uff09", "content_html": "Overlay ECMP with BFD monitoring \u2014 VxLAN VNet \u7d4c\u8def (VNET_ROUTE_TUNNEL_TABLE) \u306b\u8907\u6570 endpoint \u3092 ECMP \u3067\u4e26\u3079\u3001\u5404 endpoint \u306e\u751f\u5b58\u6027\u3092 BFD \u3067\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3001Down \u30e1\u30f3\u30d0\u3092 NHG \u304b\u3089\u5916\u3057\u305f\u3044\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/overlay-ecmp-with-bfd-monitoring.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T19:08:13+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/mclag-enhancements/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/mclag-enhancements/", "title": "MCLAG Enhancements\uff08dynamic config / unique IP / isolation group / static MAC\uff09", "content_html": "MCLAG \u3092 7 \u8ef8\uff08dynamic config\u30fb\u30bf\u30a4\u30de\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30fbstatic MAC \u540c\u671f\u30fbaging \u7121\u52b9\u5316\u30fbMAC sync \u6700\u9069\u5316\u30fbisolation group\u30fbunique IP\uff09\u3067\u5f37\u5316\u3059\u308b HLD \u306e\u6982\u8981\u30cf\u30d6\u3002\u518d\u8d77\u52d5\u306a\u3057\u8a2d\u5b9a\u5909\u66f4\u3068 L3 \u30d7\u30ed\u30c8\u30b3\u30eb\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3092\u5b9f\u73fe\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/mclag-enhancements.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-10T00:53:37+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-fips-deployment/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/sonic-fips-deployment/", "title": "SONiC FIPS 140-3 \u30c7\u30d7\u30ed\u30a4\uff08FIPS table \u3068 /etc/fips/fips_enabled\uff09", "content_html": "SONiC FIPS 140-3 \u30c7\u30d7\u30ed\u30a4 \u2014 \u30c7\u30fc\u30bf\u30bb\u30f3\u30bf\u7528\u9014\u3067 FIPS 140-3 \u9069\u5408\u304c\u8981\u6c42\u3055\u308c\u308b\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3001FIPS \u30c6\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u3068 /etc/fips/fips_enabled \u3092\u7528\u3044\u3066 SONiC \u4e0a\u3067 OpenSSL FIPS \u30e2\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u6709\u52b9\u5316\u3059\u308b\u8a2d\u8a08\u3068\u624b\u9806\u3092\u89e3\u8aac\u3059\u308b\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/sonic-fips-deployment.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-09T16:08:55+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/", "title": "Multi-ASIC / VOQ Chassis", "content_html": "Multi-ASIC / VOQ Chassis \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u304c\u300c1 \u3064\u306e NOS \u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30bf\u30f3\u30b9\u3067\u8907\u6570 ASIC \u3092\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f\u8907\u6570 line card \u3092 1 \u3064\u306e\u8ad6\u7406\u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u3068\u3057\u3066\u898b\u305b\u308b\u300d\u305f\u3081\u306e\u4ed5\u7d44\u307f\u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u3066\u8aad\u3080\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/advanced/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/advanced/", "title": "\u767a\u5c55\u30c8\u30d4\u30c3\u30af", "content_html": "VOQ chassis \u56fa\u6709\u306e\u30c6\u30fc\u30de (BGP / LAG / Everflow / Reliable TSA / Multi-ASIC warm reboot) \u3092\u3001\u4ed6\u7ae0\u672c\u6587\u3068\u5bfe\u5fdc\u4ed8\u3051\u3066\u6a4b\u6e21\u3057\u3059\u308b\u30e1\u30e2\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/12-multi-asic-voq/advanced.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:29:50+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/14-platform-port-optics/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/14-platform-port-optics/", "title": "Platform / Port / Optics / PHY", "content_html": "Platform / Port / Optics / PHY \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u306e\u300c\u7269\u7406\u5c64\u306b\u8fd1\u3044\u9762\u300d\u3092 1 \u3064\u306e\u8aad\u307f\u53e3\u306b\u675f\u306d\u308b\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/14-platform-port-optics/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:33:17+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}, {"id": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/17-srv6-mpls/", "url": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/17-srv6-mpls/", "title": "SRv6 / MPLS / Path Tracing", "content_html": "SRv6 / MPLS / Path Tracing \u2014 \u3053\u306e\u7ae0\u306f\u3001SONiC \u3067 SRv6\uff08Segment Routing over IPv6\uff09\u3001MPLS\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u7d4c\u8def\u89b3\u6e2c\u306e\u305f\u3081\u306e Path Tracing \u3092\u307e\u3068\u3081\u3066\u8aad\u3080\u305f\u3081\u306e\u5165\u53e3\u3067\u3059\u3002", "image": "https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/17-srv6-mpls/index.png", "date_modified": "2026-06-06T17:59:22+00:00", "date_published": "2026-05-11T01:31:32+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": []}]}